{"created": "2025-04-01T12:52:27.244129+00:00", "modified": "2025-09-09T07:55:49.649030+00:00", "id": 14996806, "conceptrecid": "14996805", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.14996806", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.14996805", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.14996806", "metadata": {"title": "Annotated Image Dataset for defects detection in Laser Powder Bed Fusion", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.14996806", "publication_date": "2025-03-09", "description": "<p>This dataset contains 2,638 high-resolution powder bed (PB) images and 2674 optical tomography (OT) images with visible defects, collected from the EOS M290 machine during the laser-based powder bed fusion (PBF-LB) process. The PB images were collected by the EOSTATE PowderBed monitoring system before and after each layer's exposure. The OT images provide layer-wise thermal and structural insights during the build.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>All samples were printed with 316L stainless steel powder (Dv(25) = 22 &micro;m, Dv(50) = 37 &micro;m, Dv(75) = 58 &micro;m), recoating speed 80 mm/s. Detailed process parameters for each set are:</p>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p>Set</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>Laser Power</p>\n<p>(W)</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>Scan Speed (mm/s)</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>Hatch Distance (mm)</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>Layer Thickness (&micro;m)</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>Volumetric Energy Density (J/mm&sup3;)</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p>1</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>80 - 250</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>780 - 3120</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>0.09</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>40</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>8.89, 17.81, 26.71, 35.61</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p>2</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>215</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>1083</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>0.09</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>40</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>55.15</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p>3</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>195</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>1083</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>0.09</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>20</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>100.03</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>In addition to the raw images, the dataset includes manually labeled annotations and preprocessed and cropped images suitable for the training and validation of machine learning and deep learning models:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Original Images and Manual Labels: Includes 2,638 raw powder bed (PB) images (JPEG, 1280&times;1024 pixels) and 2,674 optical tomography (OT) images (JPEG, 2000&times;2000 pixels), along with their corresponding manual annotations in XML format, created using LabelImg.</li>\n<li>Cropped Defects and Classification: Provides defect-centered image crops with binary class labels (\"Good\" vs \"Defects\") for image classification tasks.</li>\n<li>Preprocessed Data: Includes resized and normalized images, cropped to consistent dimensions and ready for data augmentation and model training. This is designed for defect detection using object detection models.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>This image dataset can be used for image recognition, object detection, and other potential research in Metal Additive Manufacturing.&nbsp;</p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Yin, Xinyi", "affiliation": "Aalto University", "orcid": "0009-0002-8427-3374"}, {"name": "Akmal, Jan Sher", "affiliation": "Aalto University", "orcid": "0000-0002-7452-0485"}, {"name": "Salmi, Mika", "affiliation": "Aalto University", "orcid": "0000-0002-7295-3551"}, {"name": "Bj\u00f6rkstrand, Roy", "affiliation": "Aalto University", "orcid": "0000-0002-4693-9510"}], "related_identifiers": [{"identifier": "10.36922/MSAM025150022", "relation": "isSupplementTo", "resource_type": "publication-article", "scheme": "doi"}], "resource_type": {"title": "Dataset", "type": "dataset"}, "license": {"id": "cc-by-4.0"}, "relations": {"version": [{"index": 0, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "14996805"}}]}}, "title": "Annotated Image Dataset for defects detection in Laser Powder Bed Fusion", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/14996806", "self_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/14996806", "preview_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/14996806?preview=1", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.14996806", "self_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.14996806", "self_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.14996806", "reserve_doi": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/14996806/draft/pids/doi", "parent": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/14996805", "parent_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/14996805", "parent_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.14996805", "parent_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.14996805", "self_iiif_manifest": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:14996806/manifest", "self_iiif_sequence": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:14996806/sequence/default", "files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/14996806/files", "media_files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/14996806/media-files", "archive": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/14996806/files-archive", "archive_media": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/14996806/media-files-archive", "latest": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/14996806/versions/latest", "latest_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/14996806/latest", "versions": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/14996806/versions", "draft": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/14996806/draft", "access_links": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/14996806/access/links", "access_grants": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/14996806/access/grants", "access_users": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/14996806/access/users", "access_request": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/14996806/access/request", "access": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/14996806/access", "communities": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/14996806/communities", "communities-suggestions": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/14996806/communities-suggestions", "request_deletion": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/14996806/request-deletion", "file_modification": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/14996806/file-modification", "quota_increase": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/14996806/quota-increase", "requests": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/149968